- September 30, 2025: $1,250 USDC
- December 31, 2025: $1,250 USDC
(and continuing quarterly for 3 years)

Maturity Date: December 31, 2027
At maturity: Principal ($100,000 USDC) + final interest payment
```

**Expected AI Extraction:**
```json
{
  "contractType": "bond",
  "principalAmount": 100000,
  "interestRate": 5.0,
  "paymentAmount": 1250,
  "currency": "USDC",
  "frequency": "quarterly",
  "startDate": "2025-01-01",
  "endDate": "2027-12-31",
  "maturityDate": "2027-12-31",
  "payerAddress": "0xcccc...dddd",
  "payeeAddress": "0xeeee...ffff",
  "assetDescription": "Real Estate Bond REB-2025-001"
}
```

### Contract 4: Construction Milestone (Multi-Phase)

```
CONSTRUCTION SERVICE AGREEMENT

Project: Office Building Renovation - Phase 1
Contractor: BuildRight Construction (Wallet: 0x1111...2222)
Client: PropCo Real Estate LLC (Wallet: 0x3333...4444)

Total Contract Value: $150,000 USDC

Milestone Payment Schedule:
1. Foundation & Demolition: $30,000 USDC (Due: Feb 1, 2025)
2. Structural Work: $45,000 USDC (Due: March 15, 2025)
3. Electrical & Plumbing: $35,000 USDC (Due: April 30, 2025)
4. Finishing & Inspection: $40,000 USDC (Due: June 1, 2025)

Payment Condition: Each milestone payment released upon submission 
of photographic evidence and approval by project manager.

Project Manager: John Anderson (Approver Wallet: 0x5555...6666)
```

**Expected AI Extraction:**
```json
{
  "contractType": "construction",
  "totalAmount": 150000,
  "currency": "USDC",
  "frequency": "milestone",
