   - No manual form filling
   - Works with ANY contract format
   - Extracts complex payment logic
   - **Unique:** Most projects use templates/forms

2. ✅ **AI Payment Decision Engine** (Autonomous Approvals)
   - AI evaluates conditions before paying
   - Learns from contract terms
   - Prevents invalid payments
   - **Unique:** Most projects just schedule, don't decide

